# --- Legacy raw binary archive ---
# The curated TEXT history (papers, logs, reports) IS committed under legacy/.
# The raw binary archive (zips, large PDFs) is NOT — it is too heavy for git
# and is preserved separately (see legacy/README.md).
legacy/raw/

# --- Frontier scratch ---
# Quarantined speculative work may keep scratch outputs out of git.
frontier/**/scratch/

# --- Genesis raw transcripts: contain third-party PII; public repo, keep private ---
legacy/reports/genesis/*.txt

# --- Local AI coding-session state (scheduled-task locks, etc.) — never commit ---
.claude/
.tmpwork/

# --- Cosmogony sweep (firewalled, uncommitted literature workspace) ---
cosmogony/
*.log1
*.log2

# seat-local AI pointers (never committed; see WORKING_RULES.md §11)
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# --- Untracked working-tree residue (Review 32 cleanup, 2026-07-29) ---
# These are ignored so `git status` is clean AND an accidental `git add -A` cannot stage them.
# The `tracked-forbidden` gate already REJECTS the first three if they ever enter the index;
# this is the belt to that gate's braces. Nothing here is deleted — all files stay on disk.
#
# NOT silently disappeared — what each one is, for the record:
#   Archive.zip                     4.9 MB June-2026 audit-room snapshot (1617 files); superseded.
#   .github/                        a CI workflow; GOVERNANCE forbids tracking it (gate: tracked-forbidden).
#   papers/flagship/*dritero-m.pdf  carries the owner's surname — MUST NOT be committed (privacy rule).
#   B500 stragglers                 a REAL but unbanked run record: "26 TIMEOUT + 9 never-reached = 35
#                                   of 150", PARI stack overflows. Kept on disk; noted in PROGRESS_LOG
#                                   rather than hidden. If it is ever wanted, it belongs banked in the
#                                   arc, not committed loose.
#   B729 b729_err.txt               a tkinter import warning, 228 bytes of noise.
Archive.zip
.github/
papers/flagship/*dritero-m.pdf
frontier/B500_child_hunt/b500_stragglers.py
frontier/B500_child_hunt/b500_stragglers_out.txt
frontier/B500_child_hunt/b500_stragglers_err.txt
frontier/B729_amplitude_sector/b729_err.txt
